<title>NEW ZEALAND: Guinness Peat ditches 34 pct Colonial stake.</title>
<headline>Guinness Peat ditches 34 pct Colonial stake.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New Zealand Stock Exchange said on Friday Guinness Peat Group, United Kingdom, had sold its 33.9 percent stake in Colonial Motor Company.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom 64 4 473-4746</p>
</text>
